# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Large-file and privacy policy (see docs/README.md and the review report)
# Stays in the repository: code, docs, small result tables, manifests, figures.
# Excluded: cached feature arrays, per-image index copies, error logs, raw remote logs, third-party metadata.
# The excluded feature files are published as a release / archive with SHA-256 checksums
# (the checksums are kept in the manifest.json files that stay in the repository).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Datasets must never be committed (they live outside the repository)
data/
datasets/
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# Cached features: 14 .npy files, 404 MB in total (DINOv2, BioCLIP, PlantWild); one file is 159 MB (GitHub rejects files over 100 MB)
*.npy
# Per-image feature index copies (12-13 MB each; rebuilt by data_prep/05a_build_feature_index.py)
results/05_features_dinov2/feature_index.csv
results/05_features_dinov2/remote/features_dinov2/features_index.csv
results/06_features_bioclip/remote/features_bioclip/features_index.csv

# Raw logs of the remote GPU runs (JSON event streams that contain environment paths)
results/**/remote/*.log
results/code_audit_result/plant-data-audit.log
# Local audit stdout log: first line holds the absolute path of the local data folder
results/local_audit/audit.log

# Error / warning streams (contain absolute local paths and thousands of repeated warnings)
*.err
*.err.log

# Run logs written next to the results at the top of results/ (stdout logs are kept: they document each run)
results/_rerun_*.log
results/_rerun_*.err

# Twelve third-party web photographs from PlantWild (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0) kept by the audit script; not redistributed
results/plantwild_audit/samples/

# Third-party metadata copy (PlantSeg v6 Metadata.csv): fetch it from the dataset record instead,
# see docs/data_sources.md. Remove this line only if the licence check allows redistribution.
reference/

# Secrets and local configuration (none are used by the code; kept out as a precaution)
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.claude/

# Temporary and local files
_patch*.py
_apply*.py
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
